What is the output of this code?

```csharp
using System;

namespace MyApplication
{
    class Program
    {
        static void Main(string[] args)
        {
            int a = 4;
            int b = 1;
            while(a != b)
            {
                Console.Write(b + " ");
                b++;
            }
        }
    }
}
```

